1
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
Some secrets should stay buried.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Burial is a thriller, war, horror film directed by Ben Parker.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
Set in the last days of World War II, a small band of Russian soldiers led by intelligence officer Brana
Vasilyeva, who is tasked with trafficking the remains of Hitler back to Stalin in Russia.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
En route, the unit is attacked by German ‘Werewolf’
partisans and picked off one-by-one.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
Brana leads her surviving comrades in a last stand to ensure their ‘cargo’ doesn’t fall into
the hands of those who would see it buried in order to hide the truth forever.

6
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Brana Brodskaya, played by Charlotte Vega.

7
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Mikhail 'Tor' Oleynik, played by Barry Ward.

8
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Cpt. Vadim Ilyasov, played by Dan Renton Skinner.

9
