12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The Burial is a 2023 American legal drama film directed by
Maggie Betts and written by Betts and Doug Wright.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
It is loosely based on the true story of lawyer Willie E.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
Gary and his client Jeremiah Joseph O'Keefe's lawsuit against the Loewen funeral company, as
documented in the 1999 New Yorker article of the same name by Jonathan Harr.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
It stars Jamie Foxx as Gary, Tommy Lee Jones as O'Keefe,
Jurnee Smollett, Mamoudou Athie, and Bill Camp.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
It premiered at the Toronto International Film Festival on September 11, 2023, and was released by Amazon MGM
Studios in a limited release on October 6, 2023, prior to streaming via Prime Video on October 13, 2023.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
The film explores themes of world war ii, joseph stalin,
werewolf, nazi occultism, adolf hitler.

18
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The tone is dark and intense.
